# Homarr Docker Environment Variables

# Web UI Port
HOMARR_PORT=7575

# Docker Integration
# ==================
# The Docker socket is mounted read-only to enable:
# - Container status display (up/down)
# - Container restart from dashboard
# - Auto-discovery of services
#
# To disable Docker integration, remove the socket volume mount.

# First Run
# =========
# No authentication by default.
# Configure authentication in Settings → Users after first access.
